# Sunken Citadel: "{T}: Add two mana of the chosen color. Spend this mana only to activate abilities of land sources."
# A land card in a hand is a land source (the ruling: abilities of a land card in your hand or graveyard), so both of the
# restricted {U}{U} go to one ability: Otawara, Soaring City's channel, {3}{U} from the hand, the Island and the Mox
# paying the rest (CR 106.6, 602.2b). Llanowar Elves goes back to Bot2's hand and nothing is left in the pool.

[Bot1 Deck]
Sunken Citadel
Mox Sapphire
Otawara, Soaring City
Island
Island x3
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x5
Forest x10

